oved.\n\n**Purchase order PO0001**: placed, shipping to HQ\n- 3 \u00d7 DK-200 USB-C docks (new) at $189 each: $567\n- 3 \u00d7 MN-32 32-inch 5K monitors (new) at $529 each: $1,587\n- **Total: $2,154**\n\nThe total is under the $2,500 limit that needs manager approval, but the order was still sent for human approval and came back marked \"Approved. Looks right.\" The DK-200 was in stock, so I didn't need the DK-210 successor. Both items on the order are new.", "type": "text"}]}]}